{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >It Came From Above Us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tokyo\u2019s future looks bright\u2014until strange discoveries pull two lives into the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Rei, a curious high school student whose path collides with Mio, an enigmatic scientist. What starts as chance encounters spirals into something much larger: secrets buried beneath the city, questions written across the stars, and a countdown no one can ignore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Together, you\u2019ll search for the truth\u2014through moments of suspense, danger, and fragile trust. Every step forward brings you closer to either hope\u2026 or disaster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172750/extras/e360d81a74ecfb9a86d1235ce9110e3c.avif?t=1757599501\" width=1280 height=716 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It Came From Above Us</i> places you in a suspense-filled future Tokyo, where the shadow of a celestial threat grows ever closer. As Rei and Mio\u2019s lives intertwine, you\u2019ll uncover hidden truths, confront danger, and experience a story where every moment feels urgent.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172750/extras/f8672d9f11a00ab9fe7d661fc9faedc6.poster.avif?t=1757599501\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172750/extras/f8672d9f11a00ab9fe7d661fc9faedc6.webm?t=1757599501\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172750/extras/f8672d9f11a00ab9fe7d661fc9faedc6.mp4?t=1757599501\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Compelling Story</strong><br>Unravel a linear, tightly woven narrative blending suspense, mystery, and human emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Striking Visuals</strong><br>Expressive characters and richly detailed backdrops bring Tokyo\u2019s streets, skies, and secrets to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interactive Gameplay</strong><br>Quick-time events and immersive sequences keep you actively engaged in tense situations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgettable Characters</strong><br>Mio, Rei, and those around them are crafted with depth\u2014each carrying flaws, dreams, and struggles that resonate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emotional Soundtrack</strong><br>A carefully composed score amplifies the intimacy, urgency, and drama of every scene.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Immersive Visual Novel Experience</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Narrative focus:</strong> A complete, linear story designed to pull you in from start to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving bonds:</strong> Watch relationships grow and shift as events unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visual immersion:</strong> Artwork captures both the vibrancy of Tokyo and the looming sense of unease.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It Came From Above Us</i> is a story-driven visual novel about secrets, sacrifice, and the fragile line between wonder and catastrophe.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172750/extras/928fa643f906e49131f601f8f1dbbd2e.avif?t=1757599501\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3172750/extras/9e6d5b0b24186fe2d1de0428f31e5194.avif?t=1757599501\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\